🛠️ How to Use
Open Chromium (Chrome, Edge, Opera, or Brave) and navigate to your Google My Activity - YouTube History page.

Open DevTools (F12 or Ctrl + Shift + I / Cmd + Option + I on macOS) and click on the Console tab.

Paste the contents of yt_history_ndjson.js into the console and press Enter.

Keep the browser tab active in the foreground. .jsonl files will download automatically as the script scrolls through your timeline.
